            <p class="text-slate-100 font-bold text-xl mt-1">€849</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">50 GB</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-slate-700/50 text-center">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-sm">Pro</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-100 font-bold text-xl mt-1">€1,599</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">100 GB</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-slate-700/50 text-center">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-sm">Pro+</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-100 font-bold text-xl mt-1">€2,999</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">200 GB</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-slate-700/50 text-center">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-sm">Premium</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-100 font-bold text-xl mt-1">€6,499</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">500 GB</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-slate-700/50 text-center">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-sm">Addon</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-100 font-bold text-xl mt-1">€50</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">+1 端口</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">大流量用户可定制高达 4TB 套餐，GB 单价更低</p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"/></svg>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">支付方式</h2>
          <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30">官方支持</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"/></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">银行转账</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">比特币</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"/></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">信用卡（即将）</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-3">具体支付方式请以官网结算页面为准</p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>真实 SIM 卡 + 真实设备，IP 纯净度极高</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>4G 速度最高 60Mbps，独享带宽不共享</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>旋转 IP 成功率 99%+，全新 IP 不重复</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>提供免费 Demo 试用，无需预付</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>Web 界面 + 浏览器插件 + API 三重接入</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>社媒账户存活率提升 70%+，适合 Facebook/Google 运营</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>仅移动代理一个产品线，无住宅/DC/ISP 代理</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>定价较高，按 GB 计费适合专业测试场景而非长期大量爬虫</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>无中文界面，主要面向欧美企业客户</span></li>
