              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>需预约演示通话才能获取免费试用</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>无公开 IP 池数量，仅保证运营商数量和并发端口</span></li>
